    "contentHtml": "<p>(과학과제연구) 학습활동지 모음(탐구방법,연구윤리,보고서쓰기)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>여기 저기 자료를 모아서, 만든, 1시간짜리 빈칸채우기 수업 활동지 입니다. 수업용으로만 써주세요~^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1. 과학의 탐구</p><p>2.과학연구윤리</p><p>3.과학탐구보고서쓰기</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ac643d253fc9c54918dc63ad8bd64f8ea578ece8?download\" data-file-name=\"과학과제연구_학습활동지_1_과학의_탐구_방법.hwp\" data-file-size=\"576000\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfL6Q%26dataid%3D6%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20250818224359&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fac643d253fc9c54918dc63ad8bd64f8ea578ece8')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">과학과제연구_학습활동지_1_과학의_탐구_방법</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">562.50KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc8a1b53ea40f8979de207e679020875ca9a67e6?download\" data-file-name=\"과학과제연구_학습활동지_2_과학연구윤리.hwp\" data-file-size=\"203264\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfL6Q%26dataid%3D6%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20250818224359&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Ffc8a1b53ea40f8979de207e679020875ca9a67e6')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">과학과제연구_학습활동지_2_과학연구윤리</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">198.50KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2b642783acb353f81c4531b87a81ccc2ef53d17c?download\" data-file-name=\"과학과제연구_학습활동지_3_과학탐구보고서쓰기.hwp\" data-file-size=\"184832\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfL6Q%26dataid%3D6%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20250